% Specifically, first, we introduce the  CriticLeanGPT model, which critically evaluates Lean 4 code and ensures alignment with the original mathematical problem. Then, to evaluate the performance of the CriticLeanGPT, we present CriticLeanBench, a comprehensive benchmark designed to test the accuracy and efficiency of models in the formalization process. Our experiments demonstrate significant advancements in autoformalization accuracy compared to existing methods, highlighting the potential of CriticLean in advancing mathematical formalization. 
