\end{equation}
which is not continuous at $\Delta t_{i,1}\to 0$.
Thus, \eqref{eq:v-ode} may admit multiple particular solutions, and Theorem \ref{thm:no-overshoot} restricts us to the set of initial states that guarantees our solution doesn't overshoot the distance $\Delta p_i$.

