To quantitatively assess the capability in preserving cuer-specific acoustic characteristics, we analyze the latent cuer embeddings extracted from generated speech using Resemblyzer\footnote{https://github.com/resemble-ai/Resemblyzer}. The embeddings are projected into 2D space via t-SNE \cite{maaten2008visualizing} for visual interpretation.
