\vspace{-0.2cm}
To better understand the limitations of ALMs, we conduct a fine-grained error analysis on 100 failed predictions from Audio-Reasoner. Each case is manually categorized into four error types: perceptual errors, knowledge errors, reasoning errors, and other errors, given with examples in Table~\ref{tab:error_type}. 

