\paragraph{Perception Layer. }
This layer requires the model to interpret perceptual patterns in audio, such as identifying the type of sound, the speaker's paralinguistic features, or the instrumentation in music. These tasks depend on human-like perceptual abstraction beyond raw signal analysis.
\begin{AIbox}{Examples}
Recognizing whether a voice sounds like; identifying the presence of a crowd; distinguishing between classical and electronic music.
