by induction, $\hat\beta_1=\hat\beta_0^\klstar\comp\gamma^\com = [\eta,\beta_0]^\klstar\comp T\iota^\mone\comp\gamma^\com = \beta_1$ and
$\hat\beta_{n+1}=\hat\beta_n^\klstar\comp\gamma^\com =(\beta_n)^\klstar\comp\gamma^\com = [\eta,\beta_n]^\klstar\comp T\iota^\mone\comp\gamma^\com = \beta_{n+1}$.
