However, the boundary conditions are not perfectly transparent.  (They are designed to be entropy-stable.) Nevertheless, since their reflective properties may be of interest, the differences to the freestream are listed in Table \ref{tab:diag_out}. We note that there is little difference between the different grids indicating that the these values represent reflections rather than numerical errors caused by the discretisation scheme.

