    \item Augmentations like \textbf{temporal shifting} significantly improve generalization.
    \item Attention-based architectures outperform CNN-GRU models for this task.
    \item Future improvements could focus on \textbf{handling overlaid credits} and \textbf{multi-modal learning} for robustness.
\end{itemize}

