In a nutshell, the dynamics function is abstracted through re-writing and construction of piecewise linear upper and lower bounds $\forall x \in \mathcal D .f_{i_{LB}}(x) \leq f_i(x) \leq f_{i_{UB}}(x)$ for each nonlinear function $f_i$ 
