\includegraphics[width=0.5\textwidth]{basic}
\caption{The figure above shows $\ub(p),\lb(p)$, and the upper and lower piercing barriers $\lpb(R,p)$ and $\upb(R,p)$ of $\Piece(R,p)$.
The slab $\Slab(R,p)$ containing
