  $L \dashv R\colon \mathbb{D} \to \mathbb{C}$
  with the unit $\eta\colon \id \Rightarrow RL$ and counit $\epsilon\colon LR \Rightarrow \id$.
  The adjoint transpose is written as $\overline{(-)}$.
