\end{equation*}
 Now, using continuity and boundedness  of $ T_{\g}(y)$ implies that there exist a real constant $\theta$ such that $ \int_{0}^{1}T'_{\g+1}(y) \  dy = \theta$, we get the bound as follows:
\begin{equation*}\label{P3_E15}
