Now, putting these values in equation \eqref{P3_cgt3}, we get
\begin{equation*}\label{P3_E20}
     \lVert \6_{\2, \5}\rVert_{2}^{2} \; \leq 2^{-2 \2} \beta^{2}\theta^{4} \sum_{\3 = 2^{\2}}^{\infty} 
 \left(\sqrt{\frac{2}{z_{\3}}} \right)^{2} \sum_{\g = \5}^{\infty} \frac{1}{(\g+1)^{2}} \sum_{\1 = 2^{\2}}^{\infty}   \left(\frac{\sqrt{2}}{\sqrt{z_{\1}}} \right)^{2}\sum_{\R = \5}^{\infty}  \frac{1}{(\R+1)^{2}},
