 \STATE Apply Doppler filtering in \eqref{eq:SpectralMF} and construct the sample autocorrelation matrix $\hat{\bf R}^{\hat{f}_i}$ in \eqref{eq:RDopplerFinal}.
 \STATE Obtain the candidate angles $\hat{\theta}_{f_i}[p]$ by using the MUSIC spectrum $g^{f_i}(\theta)$ in \eqref{MUSICDoppler}.
