\section{Conclusion}

We have initiated the study of the perfect matching problem in the link activation model in the synchronous setting.
In future work, it will be interesting to extend these results to other graph problems such as maximal independent sets. 
Moreover, an open question is whether a perfect matching is possible by sending only $O(n)$ pulses in the port numbering model.
